  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/configureddefaults/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/configureddefaults/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Twitter&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/configureddefaults/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Configured Defaults</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 是一個用於打包的實用程序模組，可自動從默認位置將缺失的文件夾和文件複製到遊戲或服務器目錄中。 📦</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">它的主要目的是幫助打包製作者分發默認配置文件。尤其是當在更新中添加新模組時，確保玩家得到預期的配置，而不是讓模組在第一次啟動時自己生成默認值。 ⚙️</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">該模組支持遊戲目錄中的任何文件或文件夾，使其用途遠遠不僅限於配置文件。 📁</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此外，</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">options.txt</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 會受到特殊處理。不會替換現有文件，而是將新增設置合併到默認版本中，從而保留玩家的原有偏好。 ✨</span></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/configureddefaults/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> CLIENT和SERVER上可選安裝</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/configureddefaults/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">有關如何使用此模組的進一步說明見 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">configureddefaults/README.md</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> ，在首次運行遊戲且已安裝模組後生成。</span></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/configureddefaults/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 感謝 shedaniel 以及他們的 YOSBR 模組作為基礎。</span></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/configureddefaults/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\r\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/magnumtorch/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\r\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/new-paper-doll\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/paperdoll/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-insights\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantmentinsights/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\r\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/permanent-sponges\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/permanentsponges/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\r\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/straw-statues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/strawstatues/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fantastic-wings\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/fantasticwings/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\r\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stoneworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stoneworks/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-heads\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/alltheheads/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\r\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\r\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/configureddefaults/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\r\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/configureddefaults/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
